rrie","a":"1989-01-02","l":60,"img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/647/1619147.jpg"},{"s":7,"e":2,"t":"Days of Fines and Closures","a":"1989-01-09","l":60,"d":"When Dave's relief manager lets him down at short notice, he asks Terry to step into the breach and run the Winchester Club for him. However, concerns mount for both Terry and Arthur when the landlord fails to return as planned - especially as the club's licence is due for imminent renewal.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/647/1619149.jpg"},{"s":7,"e":3,"t":"Fatal Impression","a":"1989-01-16","l":60,"d":"Arthur becomes involved with a gambler, whose sudden death leaves the dodgy car dealer £2,000 worse off. Meanwhile, Terry helps his old flame Sylvie leave her abusive husband.","img":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/647/1619150.jpg"},{"s":7,"e":4,"t":"The Last Video Show","a":"1989-01-23","l":60,"d":"A tape implicating two senior police officers in a criminal conspiracy is mistakenly delivered to Daley Videos, and Arthur and Terry find themselves placed in contact with its owner - a local major crime boss."},{"s":7,"e":5,"t":"Fiddler on the Hoof","a":"1989-01-30","l":60,"d":"Arthur panics when he learns that there has been a robbery of safety deposit boxes in the City, so places all his savings in the ancient safe at the lock-up. Unfortunately, they soon catch the eye of an old acquaintance from Marbella."},{"s":7,"e":6,"t":"The Wrong Goodbye","a":"1989-02-06","l":60,"d":"Arthur decides he wants to retire and Terry helps him get out of a deal with a dubious consortium of Masonic property developers."},{"s":8,"e":1,"t":"The Loneliness of the Long Distance Entrepreneur","a":"1991-09-05","l":60},{"s":8,"e":2,"t":"A Bouquet of Barbed Wire","a":"1991-09-12","l":60},{"s":8,"e":3,"t":"Whatever Happened to Her Indoors?","a":"1991-09-19","l":60},{"s":8,"e":4,"t":"Three Cons Make a Mountain","a":"1991-09-26","l":60},{"s":8,"e":